@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 11: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/cancel (Anular la nota)

actor "Vendedor / Supervisor CX" as Actor
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Actor -> Web: Tap en "Anular" + motivo obligatorio
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/2001/cancel\n(CancelDto: { reason })
Gateway -> Service: cancelRefundOrder(refundOrderId: 2001, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(2001)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { status: 'OPEN', current_workflow_instance_id: 90 }

Service -> Service: 2. assertCancellable(order, actor, payload)
note right of Service
  409 si order.status != 'OPEN': una nota
  APPROVED, REJECTED o ANNULLED no se anula
  422 si falta reason
  403 si el actor no es el vendedor dueño
  ni tiene rol de supervisión
end note

Service -> TX: 3. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> LevelsDB: 4. skipOpenLevels(90)
note right of LevelsDB
  Los niveles PENDING y el IN_PROGRESS
  pasan a 'SKIPPED' con finished_at = NOW().
  Nadie más tiene que firmar.
end note
LevelsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> InstanceDB: 5. closeInstance(90, 'CANCELLED', currentLevelOrder: NULL, finishedAt: NOW())
InstanceDB --> Service: ok

Service -> OrdersDB: 6. updateRefundOrderStatus(2001, 'ANNULLED')
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> ActionsDB: 7. insertWorkflowAction(90, NULL, 'CANCEL')
note right of ActionsDB
  - reason obligatorio
  - previous_status / new_status
  - amount_before = total, amount_after = 0.00
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 8. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

note right of Service
  ANNULLED es terminal: no hay REACTIVATE
  para una nota anulada. Las disociadas que
  ya salieron de ella siguen su propio curso.
end note

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (CancelResult: { orderStatus: 'ANNULLED' })
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK
Web --> Actor: Nota anulada
@enduml
